softpipe makes the cache of a texture unit when a texture is bound to it.
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
Copyright (C) 2026 Sergey Subbotin <ssubbotin@gmail.com>

softpipe_create_context made all of its 768 texture tile caches (six shader
stages, 128 units each, 256 KiB each) with calloc: 200 MiB. On a system that
charges a process for memory at the mapping of a range, a context that binds
one texture paid for all of them. The caches are now made by
softpipe_set_sampler_views when a view is bound to a unit that has none, and
a flush skips a unit without a cache.

